{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "大王", "id": "大王"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "毀", "id": "毀"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1000608288825715, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.20294084399669038, "source": "聞", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "聞", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 0.02061928720273561, "source": "聞", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "今", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.6337237600891445, "source": "今", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 3.709498741316672, "source": "免", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.1033629377463563, "source": "免", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.921041380952402, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.3116034685183013, "source": "大", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.187072205872201, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 0.45140220329518993, "source": "行", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.6337237600891445, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.243161672523245, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.243161672523245, "source": "行", "target": "毀"}, {"weight": 1.8376965644150804, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.630057199636836, "source": "毀", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.0163515607567266, "s